OL,3,GNEWSAFunding to help more people access
OL,4,Ahealthy food
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Hull are facing a "stark"
OL,7,Fchallenge when it comes to accessing
OL,8,Fhealthy food, the leader of the city's
OL,9,Fcouncil says.
OL,11,FThe local authority and four from
OL,12,FLincolnshire are among 45 in England
OL,13,Fthat will each receive #222,000 from
OL,14,Fthe Department for Environment Food and
OL,15,FRural Affairs (DEFRA) to help improve
OL,16,Faccess to healthy and affordable food.
OL,18,FThe authorities were chosen after being
OL,19,Fidentified as having the greatest
OL,20,Flevels of deprivation and childhood
OL,21,Fobesity.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
