OL,3,GNEWSAFunding to help more people access
OL,4,Ahealthy food
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mike Ross, leader of Hull
OL,7,FCity Council, said: "It can be
OL,8,Fincredibly difficult for some people to
OL,9,Fget the healthy food they need. So,
OL,10,Fanything that helps tackle those
OL,11,Fbarriers is really important."
